   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Possible next steps",
   "text": "You could contact the National Tay-Sachs & Allied Diseases Association, a patient group based in the United States that the atlas links to GM1 [E3f52bb3, Edc4757e]. You could also contact the Cure GM1 Foundation, a patient group based in the United States that the atlas links to GM1 [E0516da3, E0405d11]. You could ask your child's care team about joining the UPenn Natural History Study of Infantile and Juvenile GM1 Gangliosidosis Patients, which the atlas links to GM1 [E21eaa22, Edc4757e].",
